"name": "Fielmann Group AG",
"description": "Fielmann Group AG engages in the business of vision care and audiology. It offers eyewear, contact lenses, primary eyecare services, and hearing aids. Its brands include fielmann, Optika Clarus, UNIVERSITARIA, Medical, SVS Vision, and Shopko Optical. It operates through the following geographical segments: Germany, Switzerland, Austria, Spain, North America, and Other Regions. The company was founded by G\u00fcnther Fielmann on September 21, 1972 and is headquartered in Hamburg, Germany.",
